#: .\templates\website\about.html:14
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"Learn about FONTESIN – our mission, team, values, and vision for global "
"business infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"Conozca más sobre FONTESIN: nuestra misión, equipo, valores y visión para la "
"infraestructura empresarial global."

#: .\templates\website\about.html:47
msgctxt "website"
msgid "About FONTESIN"
msgstr "Acerca de FONTESIN"

#: .\templates\website\about.html:48
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"We are building the global infrastructure for trusted business "
"communication, certification, and collaboration — without borders."
msgstr ""
"Estamos construyendo la infraestructura global para una comunicación, "
"certificación y colaboración empresarial confiable, sin fronteras."

#: .\templates\website\about.html:57
msgctxt "website"
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "Nuestra Misión"

#: .\templates\website\about.html:58
msgctxt "website"
msgid "Trusted Infrastructure for Global Business"
msgstr "Infraestructura confiable para negocios globales"

#: .\templates\website\about.html:59
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"FONTESIN is a deep-tech communication and certification platform designed to "
"create a trusted, decentralized infrastructure for business. We connect "
"companies, professionals, and markets across languages, borders, and systems."
msgstr ""
"FONTESIN es una plataforma de certificación y comunicación de alta "
"tecnología diseñada para crear una infraestructura descentralizada y "
"confiable para las empresas. Conectamos empresas, profesionales y mercados a "
"través de idiomas, fronteras y sistemas."

#: .\templates\website\about.html:60
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"Our platform is not just a marketplace — it is a structured ecosystem where "
"every participant is verified, every interaction is traceable, and every "
"market is accessible through a single, unified interface."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra plataforma no es solo un mercado: es un ecosistema estructurado "
"donde cada participante es verificado, cada interacción es rastreable y se "
"puede acceder a cada mercado a través de una interfaz única y unificada."

#: .\templates\website\about.html:61
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"We are currently in our Pre-MVP phase, onboarding pioneer members, franchise "
"partners, and regional coordinators who will shape the foundation of the "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente nos encontramos en nuestra fase Pre-MVP, incorporando miembros "
"pioneros, socios de franquicia y coordinadores regionales que darán forma a "
"las bases de la plataforma."

#: .\templates\website\about.html:65
msgctxt "website"
msgid "Platform Vision"
msgstr "Visión de plataforma"

#: .\templates\website\about.html:70
msgctxt "website"
msgid "Global Reach"
msgstr "Alcance global"

#: .\templates\website\about.html:71
msgctxt "website"
